. Wenn Sie dieses Video gesehen haben, m\u00f6chten Sie selbst dort hin. Sie k\u00f6nnen mit den Tasten auf dem linken Controller umschalten: X,A: 2D Video, Y,B: 3D Video. Die Leinwand wird gew\u00f6lbt dargestellt und Sie k\u00f6nnen davor den Kopf schwenken, f\u00fcr das beste 3D Erlebnis.", "short_description": "Das Aquarium \"Blu Planet\" in Copenhagen ist eines der gr\u00f6\u00dften und sch\u00f6nsten Aquarien auf der Welt."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pocketkai.net/asp/meta-copenhagen.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pocketkai", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pocketkai.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de_CH"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8800458760062438"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391785_991785716304569_1037346702959823201_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8BlbjdwvUXcQ7kNvwFdmrIh&_nc_oc=AdmwHE3O_gcN4Injh7JfxgBx_9_Oicq_JWYvT3HRYuMbRFkbUEJNq-uco4lN4VIU6G0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfykDOf-TV54NhcE-zjagAxZsEMTuSmMC95d7HHlbe7uQQ&oe=69AC1508"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "3D Aquarium Copenhagen", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "conte